# Vercel needs public/ and nothing else. It runs no code at all now: the API is
# seven Supabase Edge Functions, reached through the /api/:path* rewrite in
# vercel.json.
#
# Everything below is the CLI, the self-hosted server, and the functions
# themselves — they run on a laptop or on Supabase. Their presence is also what
# made Vercel guess this repo was a Node server and try to boot server.mjs, so
# keeping them out of the deployment is both smaller and less ambiguous.
server.mjs
bin/
hook/
lib/
scripts/
supabase/
node_modules/

*.md
.env
.env.*
permission-demo.txt
